00:15.760" end="00:16.180">I'm </span><span begin="00:16.180" end="00:16.720">just </span><span begin="00:16.720" end="00:16.930">a </span><span begin="00:16.930" end="00:17.800">shot </span><span begin="00:17.800" end="00:18.280">away </span><span begin="00:18.280" end="00:18.550">from </span><span begin="00:18.550" end="00:19.240">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.240" end="00:21.820"><span begin="00:19.240" end="00:19.660">And </span><span begin="00:19.660" end="00:19.870">if </span><span begin="00:19.870" end="00:20.170">you </span><span begin="00:20.170" end="00:20.680">leave </span><span begin="00:20.680" end="00:21.820">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.510" end="00:25.990"><span begin="00:22.510" end="00:22.990">You </span><span begin="00:22.990" end="00:23.440">leave </span><span begin="00:23.440" end="00:23.800">me </span><span begin="00:23.800" end="00:24.580">broken</span><span begin="00:24.580" end="00:24.580">, </span><span begin="00:24.580" end="00:25.180">shattered </span><span begin="00:25.180" end="00:25.300">I </span><span begin="00:25.300" end="00:25.990">lie</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.020" end="00:28.540"><span begin="00:26.020" end="00:26.350">I'm </span><span begin="00:26.350" end="00:26.860">just </span><span begin="00:26.860" end="00:26.920">a </span><span begin="00:26.920" end="00:27.460">cross</span><span begin="00:27.460" end="00:27.760">-</span><span begin="00:27.760" end="00:28.540">hair</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.260" end="00:33.310"><span begin="00:29.260" end="00:29.680">I'm </span><span begin="00:29.680" end="00:30.220">just </span><span begin="00:30.220" end="00:30.400">a </span><span begin="00:30.400" end="00:31.420">shot</span><span begin="00:31.420" end="00:31.420">, </span><span begin="00:31.420" end="00:31.630">then </span><span begin="00:31.630" end="00:31.750">we </span><span begin="00:31.750" end="00:32.020">can </span><span begin="00:32.020" end="00:33.310">die</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.310" end="00:33.400"><span begin="00:33.310" end="00:33.400">Aaahhh</span><span begin="00:33.400" end="00:33.400">.</span><span begin="00:33.400" end="00:33.400">.</span><span begin="00:33.400" end="00:33.400">.</span><span begin="00:33.400" end="00:33.400">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.560" end="00:48.460"><span begin="00:41.560" end="00:41.590">I </span><span begin="00:41.590" end="00:42.490">know </span><span begin="00:42.490" end="00:43.240">I </span><span begin="00:43.240" end="00:43.660">won't </span><span begin="00:43.660" end="00:43.960">be </span><span begin="00:43.960" end="00:44.680">leaving </span><span begin="00:44.680" end="00:46.120">here</span><span begin="00:46.120" end="00:46.200">.</span><span begin="00:46.200" end="00:46.280">.</span><span begin="00:46.280" end="00:46.360">.</span><span begin="00:46.360" end="00:47.380">with </span><span begin="00:47.380" end="00:48.460">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.840" end="01:24.910"><span begin="01:22.840" end="01:23.140">I </span><span begin="01:23.140" end="01:23.710">say </span><span begin="01:23.710" end="01:24.100">don't </span><span begin="01:24.100" end="01:24.220">you </span><span begin="01:24.220" end="01:24.910">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.060" end="01:27.280"><span begin="01:25.060" end="01:25.360">You </span><span begin="01:25.360" end="01:26.020">say </span><span begin="01:26.020" end="01:26.170">you </span><span begin="01:26.170" end="01:26.500">don't </span><span begin="01:26.500" end="01:27.280">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.170" end="01:32.950"><span begin="01:32.170" end="01:32.267">I </span><span begin="01:32.267" end="01:32.364">say</span><span begin="01:32.364" end="01:32.461">.</span><span begin="01:32.461" end="01:32.558">.</span><span begin="01:32.558" end="01:32.655">.</span><span begin="01:32.655" end="01:32.752">take </span><span begin="01:32.752" end="01:32.849">me </span><span begin="01:32.849" end="01:32.950">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.950" end="01:34.090"><span begin="01:32.950" end="01:33.140">I </span><span begin="01:33.140" end="01:33.330">stay</span><span begin="01:33.330" end="01:33.520">, </span><span begin="01:33.520" end="01:33.710">you </span><span begin="01:33.710" end="01:33.900">don't </span><span begin="01:33.900" end="01:34.090">show</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.270" end="01:36.400"><span begin="01:34.270" end="01:34.660">Don't </span><span begin="01:34.660" end="01:35.200">move</span><span begin="01:35.200" end="01:35.200">, </span><span begin="01:35.200" end="01:35.620">time </span><span begin="01:35.620" end="01:35.710">is </span><span begin="01:35.710" end="01:36.400">slow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.640" end="01:50.320"><span begin="01:36.640" end="01:36.880">I </span><span begin="01:36.880" end="01:37.630">say</span><span begin="01:37.630" end="01:38.340">.</span><span begin="01:38.340" end="01:39.050">.</span><span begin="01:39.050" end="01:39.760">.</span><span begin="01:39.760" end="01:40.480">take </span><span begin="01:40.480" end="01:40.840">me </span><span begin="01:40.840" end="01:41.680">out</span><span begin="01:41.680" end="01:44.560">.</span><span begin="01:44.560" end="01:47.440">.</span><span begin="01:47.440" end="01:50.320">.</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.320" end="01:52.540"><span begin="01:50.320" end="01:50.650">I </span><span begin="01:50.650" end="01:51.310">say </span><span begin="01:51.310" end="01:51.490">you </span><span begin="01:51.490" end="01:51.730">don't </span><span begin="01:51.730" end="01:52.540">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.630" end="01:54.760"><span begin="01:52.630" end="01:52.930">You </span><span begin="01:52.930" end="01:53.650">say </span><span begin="01:53.650" end="01:53.710">you </span><span begin="01:53.710" end="01:54.010">don't </span><span begin="01:54.010" end="01:54.760">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.970" end="01:59.590"><span begin="01:54.970" end="01:55.210">I </span><span begin="01:55.210" end="01:56.020">say</span><span begin="01:56.020" end="01:56.700">.</span><span begin="01:56.700" end="01:57.380">.</span><span begin="01:57.380" end="01:58.060">.</span><span begin="01:58.060" end="01:58.750">take </span><span begin="01:58.750" end="01:59.110">me </span><span begin="01:59.110" end="01:59.590">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.590" end="02:01.540"><span begin="01:59.590" end="01:59.710">If </span><span begin="01:59.710" end="01:59.920">I </span><span begin="01:59.920" end="02:00.490">move</span><span begin="02:00.490" end="02:00.490">, </span><span begin="02:00.490" end="02:00.760">this </span><span begin="02:00.760" end="02:00.910">could </span><span begin="02:00.910" end="02:01.540">die</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.540" end="02:04.060"><span begin="02:01.540" end="02:01.840">If </span><span begin="02:01.840" end="02:02.290">eyes </span><span begin="02:02.290" end="02:02.800">move</span><span begin="02:02.800" end="02:02.800">, </span><span begin="02:02.800" end="02:03.070">this </span><span begin="02:03.070" end="02:03.220">could </span><span begin="02:03.220" end="02:04.060">die</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.210" end="02:09.250"><span begin="02:04.210" end="02:04.480">I </span><span begin="02:04.480" end="02:05.140">want </span><span begin="02:05.140" end="02:06.640">you</span><span begin="02:06.640" end="02:06.770">.</span><span begin="02:06.770" end="02:06.900">.</span><span begin="02:06.900" end="02:07.030">.</span><span begin="02:07.030" end="02:07.270">to </span><span begin="02:07.270" end="02:07.960">take </span><span begin="02:07.960" end="02:08.320">me </span><span begin="02:08.320" end="02:09.250">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.090" end="02:17.740"><span begin="02:13.090" end="02:13.720">I </span><span begin="02:13.720" end="02:14.350">know </span><span begin="02:14.350" end="02:14.890">I </s